18/2022/TT-NHNN issued by the SBV on 26 December 2022 on amendments to certain articles of Circular 09.
* * *
For debts recognised on the balance sheet
* * *
- Where the selling price is higher than its book value, the difference is recognised as other income in the consolidated statement of profit or loss;
