According to Circular No. 114/2021/TT-BTC dated 17 December 2021 issued by the Ministry of Finance (“Circular 114”) to replace Circular No. 146/2014/TT-BTC dated 6 October 2014 (“Circular 146”), providing guidance on the financial regime applicable to securities companies and fund management companies:
