## _43 SEASONAL OR CYCLICAL FACTORS_
The Group’s consolidated interim financial statements are not affected by seasonal or cyclical
* * *
factors except for the following items:
* * *
(a) Foreign exchange differences
* * *
As described in Notes 3(b), 3(l) and 3(n), unrealised foreign exchange differences are recognised in the foreign exchange revaluation reserve on the consolidated statement of financial position at each month-end and are transferred to the consolidated statement of profit or loss at the year-end.
* * *
(b) Statutory reserves
* * *
The Group is required to make appropriation to reserve to supplement charter capital and financial reserve annually. The Group only makes appropriation to the statutory reserves at the year-end.
