43. PROFIT MOVEMENTS
* * *
The consolidated profit after tax for the period from 1 January 2026 to 30 June 2026 of the Bank increased by VND 2,315,801 million equivalent to an increase of 18.73% compared to the period from 1 January 2025 to 30 June 2025 due to the following reasons:
* * *
Profit after tax VND million Increase in profit after tax as a result of: Increase in net interest and similar income 2,842,586 Increase in net fee and commission income 2,875,532 (Decrease) in net gain from trading foreign currencies (354,679) (Decrease) in net gain from held-for-trading securities (139,140) (Decrease) in net gain from investment securities (729,814) (Decrease) in net gain from other operating activities (205,939) (Decrease) in income from investments in other entities (26,720) (Increase) in operating expenses (1,373,531) Decrease in provision expenses for credit losses 516,875 (Increase) in corporate income tax expenses (1,096,929) Decrease in deferred tax expenses 7,560 Increase in profit after tax 2,315,801
