### Dividends (continued)
As at 30 June 2026, the SBV had not yet issued the Decision amending the Charter capital stated
* * *
in the its Establishment and Operation License for Commercial Bank relating to the increase in charter capital of the Bank. Accordingly, the Bank recognised the additional share capital amounting to VND6,677,654 million under Other capital in accordance with Circular No. 99/2025/TT-BTC issued by the Ministry of Finance on 27 October 2025, providing guidance on Vietnamese Accounting System for Enterprises. On 15 July 2026, the SBV issued Decision No. 1640/QD-NHNN approving the amendment to the Bank’s charter capital to VND58,044,219,570,000.

--- https://acb.com.vn/en/investors/financial-statements ---
