### Share capital
#### Charter capital
Charter capital of the Bank is recorded when the rights and obligations of the shareholders and
* * *
the Bank relating to charter capital are established. Charter capital is recognized at par value. Incremental costs directly attributable to the issuance of ordinary shares are recognized as a deduction from share premium.
