SUMMARY
STRUCTURE OF THE LAW ON PERSONAL INCOME TAX 2025
Chapter I. General provisions
(From Article 1 to Article 6)
Chapter II. Tax bases for residents
(From Article 7 to Article 19)
Chapter III. Tax bases for non-residents
(From Article 20 to Article 28)
Chapter IV. Implementation provisions
(From Article 29 to Article 30)
SOME IMPORTANT AND NOTABLE PROVISIONS OF THE LAW ON PERSONAL INCOME TAX 2025
1. Addition of taxable income from the transfer of gold bars and digital assets
Compared to the provisions in the Law on Personal Income Tax 2007, Article 3 of the Law on Personal Income Tax 2025 has added taxable income types, including:
- Income from agency, brokerage, and business cooperation activities with organizations;
- Income from e-commerce business activities, business based on digital platforms;
- Remuneration, monetary or non-monetary benefits in any form;
- Other income, including:
Income from the transfer of the national internet domain name "".vn"";
Income from the transfer of greenhouse gas emission reduction results, carbon credits;
Income from the transfer of auctioned vehicle license plates as prescribed under the law;
Income from the transfer of digital assets;
Income from the transfer of gold bars.
The Government stipulates the threshold value of taxable gold bars, the time of application, and the adjustment of personal income tax rates for the transfer of gold bars in line with the gold market management roadmap.
2.

--- https://english.luatvietnam.vn/law-on-personal-income-tax-no-109-2025-qh15-dated-december-10-2025-of-the-national-assembly-422733-doc1.html ---
Addition of tax-exempt and reduced income
Article 4 of the Law on Personal Income Tax 2025 adds tax-exempt income, including:
- Income from dividends of members of cooperatives, agricultural cooperative unions, individuals who are farmers contracting with enterprises participating in ""Large Fields,"" production forest planting, aquaculture.
- Income from wages and salaries of foreign experts working in programs and projects funded by non-refundable ODA, foreign non-governmental programs, and projects in Vietnam…
Additionally, Article 5 of the Law on Personal Income Tax also adds several other tax exemption and reduction cases, such as:
- Exemption from personal income tax for five years for income from wages and salaries of individuals who are high-quality digital technology industry personnel.
- Exemption from personal income tax for the transfer of open-ended fund certificates established under securities law held for two years or more from the date of purchase.
- A 50% reduction in personal income tax on dividends of individual investors distributed from securities investment funds, real estate investment funds established under the Law on Securities within the period prescribed by the Government…
3. Changes in personal income tax on business income
Article 7 of the Law on Personal Income Tax amends several notable provisions on personal income tax on business income, applicable from the 2026 tax period as follows:
- Raise the non-taxable personal income threshold to 500 million VND/year.
- Households and individual businesses are allowed to deduct expenses for tax calculation like enterprises.
- Apply a 5% tax rate for individuals renting real estate.
4. Changes in the progressive tax rate schedule for income from wages and salaries
Compared to the current regulations, the provision has reduced from 7 tax brackets to 5 brackets, with the 15% tax rate in the second bracket reduced to 10%, and the 25% tax rate in the third bracket reduced to 20%
