# Vietnamese usage of online banking services
## Online banking is an useful tool for people to save time of doing lots of transactions nowadays. Check out how the Vietnamese usage of this service.
![Vietnamese usage of online banking services](https://qandme.net/images/onlinebanking_1.png)
![Vietnamese usage of online banking services](https://qandme.net/images/onlinebanking_2.png)
Vietcom bank is most popular nation-wide, while the popularity of Vietin bank is high in the north.
63% people above 35 years old use online banking regularly. 
38% people under 24 years old are not having an online banking account. 
52% Vietnamese have concern about Security when using online banking. 
Most of Vietnamese feel comfortable using this service. 
![](https://qandme.net/images/qandme_icon_3.png)
