A message from our Chairman 
CEO Report

A message from our Chairman
From this position of 
strength, we move 
forward with conviction 
and with the bold 
ambition to become 
a financial group of 
global stature and play 
a leading role in shaping 
Vietnam’s new era of 
opportunity.
Mr. Ho Hung Anh
Chairman of the Board of Directors
In 2025, despite continued uncertainties in the global economic 
and geopolitical environment, Vietnam’s economy once again 
demonstrated remarkable resilience. The country maintained its 
strong growth momentum, reinforcing macroeconomic stability and 
further strengthening market confidence. Supported by decisive 
and flexible policies from the Government, and the concerted 
efforts of the entire political system, businesses and citizens, the 
economy accelerated significantly, achieving growth of over 8% by 
the end of the year. This sets a solid foundation for 2026, a year that 
marks the beginning of a new era of national ambition. One guided 
by a renewed vision and supported by meaningful policy reforms 
that have begun to be implemented from the start of the year.
In our 32 nd year, Techcombank and our ecosystem continued 
our unwavering commitment to empowering individuals and 
businesses to achieve their own greatness, and to contributing 
to Vietnam’s economic development. Our customer-centric 
strategy – a guiding principle throughout our journey – was further 
strengthened as we continued to introduce and scale pioneering 
financial products and services. Our product innovations enabled 
us to further expand our market share among retail customers and 
reinforce Techcombank’s position as a trusted growth partner for 
Vietnam’s business community. 
Digital, data, and talent remained the three strategic pillars of our 
transformation, while artificial intelligence (AI) became more deeply 
integrated across our ecosystem. At the same time, we continued 
to proactively attract world-class AI talent to unlock the full potential 
of the data and technology foundations that Techcombank has built 
over the years.
Techcombank, with our comprehensive ecosystem, is increasingly 
realising synergies to deliver  integrated products and services, 
seamless one-touch experiences, enhance customer retention 
and increase lifetime value. Through our ecosystem we are also 
gaining access to new high-value opportunities and reaching 
into new customer segments, which together are giving us a 
distinct competitive advantage and laying firm foundations for 
our sustainable, long-term growth. By the end of 2025, the Bank 
delivered an impressive performance with profit after tax reaching 
VND 26.0 trillion, up 19.3% compared to 2024. Its capital adequacy 
ratio (CAR) stood at 14.6%, maintaining the Bank’s leading position 
in the banking sector.
The oversubscribed IPO of Techcom Securities marked a historic 
milestone for both Techcombank and Vietnam’s capital market, 
further strengthening our leadership in wealth management. 
Meanwhile, we accelerated our life and non-life insurance 
businesses through the launch of Techcom Life Insurance and the 
strong expansion of Techcom General Insurance, further enhancing 
our integrated ecosystem model.
Our customer base grew by 2.7 million in 2025, and we are now 
proud to serve more than 18 million individuals, businesses and 
corporate clients. At the same time, our brand has strengthened 
significantly and now stands among the most trusted in the 
industry, as demonstrated by our consistently high Brand Equity 
Index and Net Promoter Scores. As a result, Techcombank is now 
widely recognized by the market as a leading financial institution 
in Vietnam and in ASEAN. This was reflected by numerous 
international recognitions, including becoming the only bank to be 
named “Best Bank in Vietnam” by Euromoney, Finance Asia and 
Global Finance for two consecutive years.
It is from this position of strength that we now embark on a new 
five-year strategy and have set bold new growth aspirations. 
We move forward together with Vietnam, with shared conviction 
and commitment, as the nation enters a new era of opportunity 
and progresses on its journey towards becoming a high-income 
economy by 2045.
The government has placed its trust in the private sector to act 
as the primary engine of economic growth and is supporting 
major investments in new infrastructure, including new airports, 
seaports and highways, creating unprecedented opportunities 
for economic advancement.  
Techcombank, with our ecosystem, stands ready to embrace this 
national responsibility and to pioneer new standards for Vietnam’s 
emerging economy. We will move forward with conviction and 
with the bold ambition to transform Techcombank from a national 
leader into a fully integrated financial institution of global stature in 
Vietnam’s new era of growth.
On behalf of the Board of Directors, I would like to extend our 
deepest gratitude to our valued shareholders and partners for their 
continued support throughout our journey.
Y ours sincerely,
Mr. Ho Hung Anh
Chairman of the Board of Directors
