synergies across our ecosystem, deliver more 
data-enabled products and hyper-personalized 
customer experiences, while driving meaningful 
gains in operational efficiency and productivity. As 
a result, Techcombank is now among the fastest 
growing and most profitable banks in Vietnam.
We now begin our next five-year strategy 
from a position of strength. We are the bank 
of choice for affluent Vietnamese and blue-
chip corporates, the nation’s leading wealth 
manager, and among the top transaction banks 
in the country. Our brand ranks among the 
strongest in the sector, as reflected by leading 
Brand Equity and Top-of-Mind scores. At the 
same time, we have reinforced our leadership 
in the real estate and bond markets, while 
maintaining the strongest capital profile in the 
Vietnamese banking sector.
Mr. Jens Lottner
Chief Executive Officer 
This milestone on our journey coincides with a pivotal moment for Vietnam. As the country 
enters a new era of high growth, to be driven by the private sector and supported by major 
investments in new digital and physical infrastructure, Techcombank is well positioned to 
capture new opportunities and accelerate our growth trajectory. 
Looking ahead, we will continue to scale our financial ecosystem platform to serve the 
needs of Vietnam’s growing affluent and mass affluent segments and further expand our 
SME and merchant businesses. We will become even more relevant in our customers’ lives 
by embedding our services into key economic sectors such as real estate, consumption and 
health. At the same time, we will aspire to be an enabler of Vietnam’s development as a 
