Auto Earning continues to serve as a strategic 
product focused on safety, differentiation, 
and personalization. The upgraded Auto 
Earning 2.0 version introduces the “Optimize 
with U-Point” feature, which allows customers 
to convert interest earnings into U-Points at 
a rate of 1 VND = 2 U-Points. This enables 
customers to double their benefits and use 
the points flexibly—for voucher redemption, 
QR payments, air-mile exchanges, and more.
 
The implementation of Auto Earning within 
the Friend Banking service has created 
a truly distinctive feature in the market, 
combining superior financial benefits with 
a community-driven experience. At the 
same time, the dynamic pricing mechanism 
based on customer profiling applied to Auto 
Earning lays the foundation for expanding 
personalized benefits to other products. As 
