with dynamic pricing tailored to tier-based 
personas, improving competitiveness and 
relevance. Integration with One Housing’s co-
broker platform strengthened Techcombank’s 
ecosystem presence, while the introduction 
of Lombard loans collateralized by term 
deposits expanded liquidity solutions for 
affluent customers. By the end of 2025, 
100% of new deposit contracts were opened 
through digital channels, and total assets 
under management increased by 20% 
compared with 2024. 
