up shared funds. Enhanced benefits 
were introduced for group bundling 
Friend Banking with Auto-earning Plus, 
strengthening both acquisition and 
retention. In 2025, approximately 68,000 
friend groups were active, while average 
balance per group increased by 38% in 
2025, reinforcing the role of social finance 
in driving sustainable balance growth.
