service through our mobile application, in-
branch support, and relationship manager-
assisted service. This multi-channel 
approach ensured our corporate clients 
could maintain uninterrupted access to 
critical banking services while meeting 
new compliance requirements.
By mid-2025, 79,186 corporate customers 
successfully completed the biometric 
authentication process. Our swift deployment 
of these digital capabilities exemplifies 
Techcombank's commitment to transforming 
regulatory requirements into value-added 
customer experiences. This proactive 
approach not only ensures regulatory 
adherence but reinforces our position as 
a trusted banking partner that anticipates 
market changes and delivers innovative 
solutions that support our clients' business 
continuity.
