IT BUILDING 
FOUNDATION TO 
DELIVER SEAMLESS 
CUSTOMER SERVICE 
IT enhanced support operations 
throughout the entire bank by managing 
technology requests from head office 
functions to frontline staff, ensuring 
seamless customer transactions both at 
the counter and across the system. By 
improving the quality of ticket resolution 
and maintaining service discipline, IT 
delivered consistently high performance, 
achieving a 99.96% Service Level 
Agreement (SLA) and a 99.71% customer 
satisfaction rate. This demonstrates 
their capability for fast and reliable issue 
resolution on a large scale.
At the same time, IT upgraded 
infrastructure in 50 branches, transforming 
standard branches into Model Branches. 
They modernized network connectivity 
by replacing wired networks with secure, 
high-performance Wi-Fi, which boosted 
employee productivity and enhanced 
the in-branch customer experience. To 
further bolster security, IT replaced all 153 
non-compliant camera servers, ensuring 
that surveillance systems met safety and 
regulatory standards across all branches, 
thereby safeguarding bank operations.
System operation forms the foundation that 
keeps the Bank running seamlessly. While 
largely behind the scenes, stable and 
secure IT operations are critical to ensuring 
uninterrupted customer transactions, 
regulatory compliance, and business 
continuity at scale. 
In 2025, Techcombank continued to 
prioritize disciplined system operations 
and proactive upgrades to safeguard core 
platforms, reduce operational risk, and 
ensure the Bank could operate smoothly 
during both normal and peak periods.
