2026 Focus
Process excellence - Building scalable 
and cost-efficient operations
People excellence - Building 
capabilities for the future growth
In 2026, Techcombank Group will 
initiate its five-year strategy for 2026–
2030, which aims to enhance market 
capitalization by unlocking synergies 
within its ecosystem and leveraging 
artificial intelligence on a large scale.
Automate technology system change implementation and enable one-click 
deployment to reduce manual intervention, execution risk, and time-to-market;
Streamline end-to-end workflows to eliminate process waste, improve productivity, 
and support faster scaling;
Strengthen execution compliance to ensure consistent, predictable outcomes across 
complex operations;
Enhance cloud cost management to support growth while maintaining cost efficiency 
and margin discipline;
Standardize ecosystem processes and platforms to accelerate cross-entity integration 
and unlock ecosystem synergies.
Foster a culture of ownership and continuous improvement build a healthy, high-trust 
working environment, where employees are encouraged to challenge the status quo, 
think independently, and pursue meaningful, long-term improvement rather than 
short-term metrics;
Build capabilities in AI-enabled DevSecOps, testing, and IT operations, strengthening 
the Bank’s AI execution engine;
Invest in leadership development, particularly for newly promoted people managers, 
to manage scale and complexity;
Expand training and sponsorship for broader employee base, strengthening the 
internal talent pipeline;
Accelerate succession planning to ensure leadership continuity throughout the 
2026–2030 strategy cycle.
