 • In 2024, the BOD has oriented, 
supervised and directed the BOM in all 
aspects of VCB’s business activities in 
accordance with the orientation and 
strategic objectives; solutions have been 
actively and synchronously implemented, 
ensuring adherence to the set roadmap 
and goals, the targets have basically 
been completed; the BOM has complied 
with the provisions of the Law on Credit 
