BUSINESS ORIENTATION 
FOR 2025
Thoroughly adhering to the Government’s policies and the State Bank of Vietnam’s regulatory directions, BIDV is determined to successfully 
implement the objectives set out in its Business Development Strategy to 2025, with a vision to 2030, as well as the bank’s component 
strategies. BIDV will also closely follow the targets of its Restructuring Plan for the 2021–2025 period. Recognizing the role as the largest 
bank by assets in the market and a key and leading institution in the sector, BIDV will continue to promote a strong sense of responsibility, 
unity, and cohesion across the system. For 2025, BIDV adopts the operational motto: “Responsibility – Streamlining – Efficiency – 
Accelerating transformation”, and strives to accomplish the 2025 business plan, with the following key targets:
